 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dSNjmR1zV1UQ7kNvwEgfVvk&_nc_oc=AdofZsd82q2x4wKm6HUE3dOtSGFTim_2lYhHMXg7YJxG7IXyH2KvHk1LzULY61Q3fVA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK1b_3xp8xTURt-umnEy-ZGxp7sLhu_8lzlessMXCsWFA&oe=6AB14AC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GRBgfHQB4FEQ7kNvwFv20Ug&_nc_oc=AdrTFNaGnAUQSxBVU7vlrrWN6FuUvn0M48Vfap_B1VWOtuKqqMOCm8nsTLYAFWX7jWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLosyIM8T79a2E8iVGILBmR2BVRNh1YojoSm2UI_gjHzA&oe=6AB15826"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A-MnbxfVzEwQ7kNvwHPg5X_&_nc_oc=Adq7lvf9aNtdocAI1o6W5p4b_iba3CHS4cj6h6JpwrGQ6wQtg0hDkt_k_ZpeM7YQ0eg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJt9YWIxkN66xCM7ta4KX1BJnzRLYMPEji-dibABsitvg&oe=6AB129DC"}, {"fil